---
/** Sparkline: a quiet label and a figure over the trend that led to it, one fine line that ends in an ink dot at the latest value. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:196px; padding:18px 18px 20px; --gap:12px">
  <i class="cover-bar" style="width:56px"></i>
  <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong cover-bar-figure" style="width:76px"></i>
  <span style="position:relative; display:block; width:157px; height:36px; margin-top:6px; color:var(--color-text-body)">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="display:block; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:visible"><path d="M0 100 L7.69 90 L15.38 93.3 L23.08 76.7 L30.77 83.3 L38.46 66.7 L46.15 56.7 L53.85 63.3 L61.54 46.7 L69.23 30 L76.92 40 L84.62 20 L92.31 10 L100 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" /></svg>
    <i class="cover-dot cover-ink" style="--d:5px; position:absolute; top:-2.5px; right:-2.5px"></i>
  </span>
</span>
